      "MAXINE: Thank you.\nCASTING DIRECTOR: Do you mind taking your top off so we can see your breasts?\nMAXINE: Yeah, sure.",
      "TABBY: Sure you don’t wanna tag along? The house is totally fabulous. It’s right under the Hollywood sign. I hear you have to take a gondola to get…\nTABBY: Your loss. Be careful walking home.\nMAXINE: I can handle myself.\nTABBY: Yeah, so said every dead girl in Hollywood...",
      "MAXINE: Did something happen?\nDETECTIVE WILLIAMS: Any idea where they might be? Could be really helpful.\nMAXINE: I don’t talk to police.\nDETECTIVE WILLIAMS: You fucked that up, not me."
